Z||000000||82-T/A||12-09-2000||12:17 PM||||Aw hell yeah!!!! I just found out today that Rare Earth, Iron Butterfly, and Sugarloaf are all having a concert together just 2 friggin blocks from my house!!! <P>Way cool. I'm soo psyched. I know I'm going to be the only one there even remotely young.. being as it's a late 60s / early 70s rock bands.. but still. Damn, I'm going to bring my Get Ready Rare Earth album for Peter Rivera to sign. Yes I'm 22 and I collect records. Sweet.. this is pretty cool. Dude!!! <P>I feel like I'm 16 again. It was only 6 years ago.. but still. I just found all my old concert clothes that I used to wear back in the 90s when I went to concerts. <P>Black Converse all stars, torn jeans, and my REM or Black Sabbath T-shirt.<P>Actually, I don't think I've washed these clothes since Ozz Fest 1997. But hey, no ones going to be sniffing me.. so who gives.<P>Wow.. totally cool.<P><P>------------------<BR>Todd Jaspers<BR>1997 Pontiac GrandAm SE<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero SE/V6<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2m4 SE<BR>http://www.ezshots.com/album.cgi?82tafiero/Apartment||||reg||6
